{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|F00D94DF4E4F82F34DE34C8BF82E2A6A", "source_en": "Prepare Knight, he is far older and more powerful than the others.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "استعد أيها الفارس، فهو أقدم وأقوى بكثير من البقية.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 27}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|F11353774D4D6592BEC8D79CDA7DE96B", "source_en": "Hurry back, Nephilim.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "عُد سريعاً، يا نيفيليم.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 27}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|F366B1CC443FF478A052E68D9B635EEB", "source_en": "A request for you.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "لديّ طلبٌ لك.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 27}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|F3BBA790453464B152477AB2E2ACE484", "source_en": "His followers gave their eyes for a glimpse at the truth he carried.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "قد بذل أتباعه أبصارهم في سبيل إلقاء نظرة على الحقيقة التي كان يحملها.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 27}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|F49307A54C4E768069A7E9821A7E2D61", "source_en": "Time to start cataloging again.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "حان الوقت للبدء في الفهرسة من جديد.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 27}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|F5BD19224D92F2EBE7214D8A27E51574", "source_en": "*sigh* Not again.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "*تنهيدة* ليس ثانيةً.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 27}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|F661B4EC4EE213BF9F5E69B0695C19D3", "source_en": "Heretics, inquisitors, and frightened citizens all saw enemies in the dark.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "رأى المهرطقون، والمحققون، والمواطنون المذعورون جميعاً أعداءً في الظلام.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 27}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|F7B9E8064B8FD85A3326FA9D0E3A5BF9", "source_en": "Curious.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "أمر مثير للفضول.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 27}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|F84ABEDB4FEB3F42A5A43FA973B7A832", "source_en": "Child.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "أيها الصغير.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 27}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|F861CD5F4AFE19072E4A6AB9578928E9", "source_en": "Is that you?", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "أأنت ذا؟", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 27}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|F8D78D3A489C72C638DBBABF3B7B5550", "source_en": "Having trouble finding that tome? Hmm... Look around. Books look much like the rectangular objects in this room. Just search the dungeons for... books. Does that help?", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "أتعاني في العثور على ذلك المجلد؟ همم... ألقِ نظرة حولك. تبدو الكتب مشابهة للأجسام المستطيلة في هذه الغرفة. ابحث في الزنازين عن... الكتب. هل هذا يساعدك؟", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 27}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|F931C9BA4C0858C0D84DE9A24843BEC2", "source_en": "A dog-eared page. How troubling.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "صفحة مطوية الزاوية. يا له من أمر مزعج.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 27}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|FAB731D141EF72834E5453BE88ECEA8B", "source_en": "Ancient god of forbidden knowledge and prophecy.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "إلهٌ قديمٌ للمعرفة المحرمة والنبوءة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 27}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|FBD2AC3240B14217B225F19AEB5F448C", "source_en": "These records paint Solomon in a different light.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "هذه السجلات تظهر سولومون في ضوءٍ مختلف.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 27}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|FC11B97046289FFD3153D6BD7894B4BC", "source_en": "Or any dead god.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "أو أي إلهٍ ميتٍ آخر.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 27}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|FC4A8AB74CCA0179CA306B8792EF822B", "source_en": "These notes tell the story of Mahkteah before his fall.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "تروي هذه الملحوظات قصة ماكتيا قبل سقوطه.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 27}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Librarian|FC6F1E0F4028F2B5285D9788185748E8", "source_en": "And yes, I'll pay you too. With powerful magic, dear.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Librarian", "ar": "ونعم، سأكافئك أنت أيضاً. بسحرٍ قوي، يا عزيزي.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 27}}
